  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Veterans Evaluation Services obligated $1.7B in FY2026 to date. Veterans Evaluation Services received 25 awards so far in the fiscal year, with an average award size of $66.3M. Obligations fell 18.5% year over year. The vendor’s multi-year pattern shows fiscal-year obligations of $617M in FY21, $691M in FY22, $693M in FY23, $1.1B in FY24, $2B in FY25, and $1.7B in FY26. All figures are contract obligations except where award values are specifically noted as total contract values. The current-year totals are partial, covering the fiscal year to date.",
