        "heading": "How has Veterans Evaluation Services’ federal revenue trended year to year?",
        "body": "Veterans Evaluation Services obligations rose from $617M in FY21 to $693M in FY23, then increased to $1.1B in FY24 and $2B in FY25 before falling to $1.7B in FY26. Veterans Evaluation Services obligations fell 18.5% year over year in the current fiscal period. The company has 25 awards so far in FY2026 to date, with an average award size of $66.3M."
